    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really?? my grandma always said butter helps soothe things and tea tree oil is like a natural antiseptic... are you sure i can't just use a little bit of something to take the sting out? i dont really want to go to the doctor if i can help it, it's kinda annoying and expensive. surely a bit of oil won't hurt?",
